OL,3,GNEWSAUnknown Canaletto work could fetch
OL,4,A#60k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA previously unknown work by the
OL,7,Frevered Italian artist Canaletto is set
OL,8,Fto go under the hammer.
OL,10,FThe rare artwork, known as a capriccio,
OL,11,Fis estimated to fetch between #40,000
OL,12,Fto #60,000 when it is sold by Mallams
OL,13,Fauction house in Abingdon, Oxfordshire,
OL,14,Flater this month.
OL,16,FCanaletto, whose real name was Giovanni
OL,17,FAntonio Canal, was born in Venice in
OL,18,F1697 and went on to become a favourite
OL,19,Fof British art collectors.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
